 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 1 – 5, use the following scenario to identify the expression, equation, or inequality described.</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>To support a local senior citizens center, a student club sent a flier home to the <span data-math=\"n\">n</span> students in the school. The flier said, “Please bring in money to support the senior citizens center. Paper money and coins accepted!” Their goal is to raise <span data-math=\"T\">T</span> dollars.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Choose the expression, equation, or inequality, from the list, that describes the given quantity.</p>",
